    <briefdescription>
<para>This cast trait just provides the default implementation of doCastIfPossible to make <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_cast_info" kindref="compound">CastInfo</ref> specializations more declarative. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>Derived</computeroutput> template parameter <emphasis>must</emphasis> be provided for forwarding castFailed and doCast. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
